      "value": "I believe this issue may be on your end, but please feel free to make a new post if it turns out to be reproducible. Send an email to support@vrchat.com, and if possible include your output log from appdata\\locallow\\vrchat\\vrchat\\output_log.txt. You should also try clearing your cache, using the steps detailed in https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/frequently-asked-questions.",
