  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At certain points for seemingly no reason when joining a friend i would be timed out on entry, and redirected to another world. As though the world was full, even if only one person is in it.\nIf this problem is occurring and i get redirected. if my friends decide to join me instead, I'll dc on them entering.\nI have never found a solution to this problem but it has occurred in the past and stopped for no known reason after a long period of not being able to get in certain worlds with friends.\nPlease don't reply with \"That's a common response from entering a full world\" the worlds it try joining are not full, I've had friends confirm.",
